              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आंतरजाल — āntarjāl — \"the internet\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गावात आता आंतरजाल चांगलं चालतं. gāvāt ātā āntarjāl cāṅglaṁ cāltaṁ. The internet works well in the village now."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In speech, इंटरनेट; आंतरजाल (āntarjāl) is the Marathi word, a net between."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
