          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आंतरजाल (āntarjāl) is a modern tatsama coinage from Sanskrit antara, \"between\", and jāla, \"net\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
